@startuml View_All_Groups_Projects
title Activity Diagram - View All Groups and Projects

|Admin|
start
:Open Admin Dashboard;
:Click "Monitor Projects";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\nall groups and projects;

|Backend API|
:Query all groups from database;
:Include related data:\n- GroupMembers\n- Projects\n- Leader\n- Class;
:Query all projects from database;
:Include related data:\n- Group\n- MilestoneEvaluations\n- MilestoneSubmissions;

:Map entities to DTOs;
:Return List of groups\nand projects;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display groups and projects list\nwith details\n(Group name, Members, Projects, Status);
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Admin|
:View all groups and projects;
stop
@enduml



